{%- comment -%}
  The Per Set mark: the hand-lettered script from the logo.

  Rendered as a CSS mask over `currentColor`, so the same asset can be
  oxblood on linen, blush on oxblood, or anything else the surface needs.
  Browsers without mask support get the blush PNG instead.

  Usage: {% render 'logo', width: '112px' %}
    width  {String}  any CSS length; the mark keeps its 819:445 aspect
    label  {String}  accessible name, defaults to the shop name
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign w = width | default: '112px'
  assign name = label | default: shop.name
-%}
<span class="ps-logomark" role="img" aria-label="{{ name | escape }}" style="--logo-w: {{ w }};">
  <img src="{{ 'perset-logo-blush.png' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="819" height="445" loading="eager" decoding="async">
</span>
